# wear/man/pattern_stripes: the man's striped cloth: a pattern tile laid over his garments' cloth (every third row in the
# pattern colour, the cloth's own shading kept through it: doll.h `tags tile`), riding the garment's anchor
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
legend T pattern 2
body man
role overlay stripes
tags tile overlay

view D key rest origin 0 0
